  "title": "Blueberry Mojito Tea Bread",
  "description": "I love mojitos and had some blueberries to use. Since I was in a baking mood rather than a cocktail mood, I created a way to use those flavors in a quick bread. We love it.",
  "authors": [
    "wisweetp"
  ],
